        "code": {
          "language": "plaintext",
          "showLineNumbers": false,
          "showMiniMap": false
        },
        "content": "<h2>OCI Metrics Overview</h2><p>This dashboard uses the native OCI Metrics datasource provisioned on the Control Plane VM with OCI Instance authentication. It focuses on OCI-DEMO namespaces that returned live data during deployment: <code>oci_computeagent</code>, <code>oci_oke</code>, <code>oci_lbaas</code>, <code>oci_autonomous_database</code>, and <code>oci_objectstorage</code>.</p><p>If you want to explore additional namespaces such as <code>oracle_appmgmt</code> or <code>oracle_apm_monitoring</code>, duplicate a panel and adjust the raw MQL query.</p>",
        "mode": "html"
      },
      "title": "Overview",
      "transparent": true,
      "type": "text"
    },
